  'act.checked': '{n} player(s) checked: a check often means “not strong”. Even medium hands can bet for value or to take the pot (but watch for a trap).',
  'style.tag': '{n} is tight-aggressive (TAG): plays few hands, plays them hard. Take bets and raises at face value.',
  'style.lag': '{n} is loose-aggressive (LAG): bets with a wide range and bluffs often. Medium hands can call them down.',
  'style.rock': '{n} is a rock: bets only with strong hands. Do not pay off with weak hands — but they also fold easily.',
  'style.station': '{n} is a calling station: rarely folds, so bluffs fail. Value-bet your good hands bigger instead.',
