  'pre.bw.o': '{h}: two high cards (top {n}%) — makes top pair often, but beware being out-kicked (AJ vs AK).',
  'pre.ax.s': '{h}: ace suited (top {n}%) — the attraction is the nut flush; a pair of aces has a weak kicker.',
